msgid "Optimization Stability and Sharpness · Phenomenon reproduction"
msgstr "优化稳定性与尖锐度 · 现象复现"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:10
msgid "Edge of Stability on a Small CPU MLP"
msgstr "小型 CPU MLP 上的稳定性边缘"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:13
msgid ""
"Full-batch gradient descent drives the top Hessian eigenvalue toward $2 /"
" \\eta = 10$, where it fluctuates while training loss falls overall but "
"not at every update."
msgstr "全批量梯度下降将最大 Hessian 特征值推向 $2 / \\eta = 10$；特征值在该处附近波动，训练损失虽总体下降，却不会在每次更新时都下降。"

