#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:40
msgid "Abstract"
msgstr "摘要"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:43
msgid ""
"This example is a small, local CPU demonstration of edge-of-stability "
"dynamics from Damian, Nichani, and Lee. With full-batch gradient descent "
"at $\\eta = 0.2$, the top Hessian eigenvalue rises toward $2 / \\eta = "
"10$ and then fluctuates around that cutoff while loss continues to "
"decrease non-monotonically. It is a qualitative reproduction, not a "
"numeric replication of the paper's curves."
msgstr ""
"本示例在本地 CPU 上以一个小型运行演示 Damian、Nichani 和 Lee 提出的稳定性边缘动力学。全批量梯度下降取 $\\eta = 0.2$ 时，"
"最大 Hessian 特征值会上升至 $2 / \\eta = 10$ 附近，随后围绕该阈值波动，而损失继续以非单调方式下降。"
"这是定性复现，并非对论文曲线的数值复刻。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:51
msgid ""
"**Paper:** [Self-Stabilization: The Implicit Bias of Gradient Descent at "
"the Edge of Stability](https://arxiv.org/abs/2209.15594), Damian, "
"Nichani, and Lee (ICLR 2023)"
msgstr ""
"**论文：** [Self-Stabilization: The Implicit Bias of Gradient Descent at the Edge "
"of Stability](https://arxiv.org/abs/2209.15594)，Damian、Nichani 和 Lee（ICLR 2023）"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:55
msgid "**Template:** `Edge of Stability (CPU)`"
msgstr "**模板：** `Edge of Stability (CPU)`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:57
msgid "**Template ID:** `edge-of-stability-cpu`"
msgstr "**模板 ID：** `edge-of-stability-cpu`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:59
msgid "Reproduction Goal"
msgstr "复现目标"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:61
msgid ""
"For gradient descent with learning rate $\\eta$, the classical local "
"stability cutoff for the largest Hessian eigenvalue $\\lambda_1(\\theta)$"
" is"
msgstr "对于学习率为 $\\eta$ 的梯度下降，最大 Hessian 特征值 $\\lambda_1(\\theta)$ 的经典局部稳定性阈值是"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:64
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\lambda_1(\\theta) \\leq \\frac{2}{\\eta}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\lambda_1(\\theta) \\leq \\frac{2}{\\eta}.\n"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:68
msgid ""
"The paper reports two linked observations. First, sharpness progressively"
" rises to this cutoff. Then, at the edge of stability, it hovers near the"
" cutoff while training loss keeps decreasing without being monotonic."
msgstr "论文报告了两个相互关联的观察。首先，尖锐度逐步上升至该阈值。随后，在稳定性边缘，尖锐度会在阈值附近波动，训练损失则持续下降但并不单调。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:72
msgid ""
"This graph records $\\lambda_1$, $\\lambda_2$, and loss at every update. "
"The Hessian visualization draws the cutoff as a dashed line at 10."
msgstr "该图在每次更新时记录 $\\lambda_1$、$\\lambda_2$ 和损失。Hessian 可视化以 10 处的虚线标出阈值。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:75
msgid "Paper Experiment and Reproduction Boundary"
msgstr "论文实验与复现边界"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:77
msgid ""
"The paper establishes edge-of-stability behavior across several standard "
"neural-network settings and gives a self-stabilization explanation: an "
"unstable excursion in the top-eigenvector direction can reduce local "
"curvature and restore stability. This template retains the fixed-"
"learning-rate, full-batch mechanism but reduces the task so that it runs "
"quickly on a local CPU."
msgstr ""
"论文在多种标准神经网络设置中展示了稳定性边缘行为，并给出自稳定解释：沿最大特征向量方向的不稳定偏移可降低局部曲率、恢复稳定。"
"该模板保留固定学习率的全批量机制，但缩小任务规模，使其能在本地 CPU 上快速运行。"

