msgstr "早期训练中，$\\lambda_1$ 上升至 10 附近。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:129
msgid ""
"After reaching the cutoff, $\\lambda_1$ fluctuates around it while "
"$\\lambda_2$ remains lower."
msgstr "达到阈值后，$\\lambda_1$ 在阈值周围波动，而 $\\lambda_2$ 保持较低。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:131
