msgstr "首次越过阈值后，损失会局部上升，但最终低于越过阈值时的值。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:134
msgid ""
"Comfy Research graph with an 80-step CPU MLP run, training loss, and the "
"top two Hessian eigenvalues around the sharpness cutoff."
msgstr "Comfy Research 图，展示一次 80 步 CPU MLP 运行、训练损失，以及尖锐度阈值附近的前两个 Hessian 特征值。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:139
msgid "Interpretation"
msgstr "解释"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:141
msgid ""
"The result is consistent with the paper's edge-of-stability account: "
"leading curvature repeatedly approaches and crosses the cutoff while loss"
" still makes net progress. The lower second eigenvalue confines the "
"observed instability to the leading-curvature direction rather than "
"showing an indiscriminate increase in all measured curvature."
msgstr "结果与论文对稳定性边缘的解释一致：主导曲率反复接近并越过阈值，损失仍取得净进展。较低的第二特征值表明，观察到的不稳定性局限于主导曲率方向，而非所有测得曲率都无差别地上升。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:147
msgid ""
"This small run does not, by itself, verify the paper's cubic self-"
"stabilization analysis or its projected-gradient-descent prediction. It "
"only makes the reported qualitative behavior directly inspectable."
msgstr "这次小型运行本身并不能验证论文的三次自稳定分析或其对投影梯度下降的预测；它只让所报告的定性行为可被直接查看。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:151
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "局限性"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:153
msgid "The synthetic task and small MLP are not the paper's empirical settings."
msgstr "合成任务和小型 MLP 并非论文的实证设置。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:154
msgid "One fixed seed does not measure seed-to-seed variation."
msgstr "单个固定 seed 无法衡量不同 seed 之间的变化。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:155
msgid ""
"The graph records only the top two Hessian eigenvalues, not the full "
"local spectrum or the paper's projected-gradient-descent trajectory."
msgstr "该图仅记录前两个 Hessian 特征值，未重建完整局部谱或论文中的投影梯度下降轨迹。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/edge-of-stability-cpu.md:158
msgid ""
"The result should therefore be read as a fast qualitative demonstration "
"of edge-of-stability behavior, not as a paper-faithful benchmark."
msgstr "因此，应将该结果视为稳定性边缘行为的快速定性演示，而非忠实复刻论文设置的基准。"
